  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports spare-parts and MRO inventory optimization at PartsVault. Stakeholders: Inventory Planner and MRO Buyer (reorder triggers, stockout risk, expedite decisions), VP Supply Chain (turnover, fill rate by category), and CFO (carrying cost, inventory tied to working capital, emergency-order premium spend).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Inventory turnover = AVG(turnover_ratio); MRO benchmark 2–4x, leaders 6x+.\n- Fill rate = AVG(fill_rate_pct); target ≥95% for critical spares.\n- Stockout events = SUM(stockout_events); each event = downtime risk.\n- Carrying cost = SUM(carrying_cost_usd); typically 20–30% of inventory value annually.\n- Days of supply = AVG(days_of_supply); MRO target 30–90 days.\n- Emergency orders = SUM(emergency_orders); each ~3–5x premium vs planned.\n- Inventory value = SUM(inventory_value_usd); working capital lever.\n- Lead time = AVG(avg_lead_time_days); supplier-performance and safety-stock input.\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - parts_transactions_metrics (source: parts_transactions) — dims: txn_date, part_category, txn_type, warehouse; measures: total_issued_qty, total_received_qty, total_transactions, emergency_issues, max_quantity.\n  - inventory_kpi_metrics (source: inventory_kpi_monthly) — dims: kpi_month, part_category; measures: avg_turnover, avg_fill_rate, total_stockouts, total_carrying_cost, total_emergency_orders, max_turnover_ratio.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. part_number, on_hand_qty, reorder_point, stockout_risk, urgency, work_order_ref).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Top 10 part categories by carrying cost — where is working capital tied up?",
    "What is the monthly trend in inventory turnover ratio by category over the trailing 12 months?",
    "Which parts are currently at High stockout risk with days of supply under 30?",
    "Rank part categories by total stockout events this quarter — which are hurting MRO service?",
    "Show monthly trend in emergency orders vs total parts transactions.",
    "Top 10 parts by emergency-order frequency, and what is the lead-time gap versus standard orders?",
    "Which categories have fill rate below the 95% target, and what is the underlying inventory value?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in emergency issues count?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', txn_date) AS month, MEASURE(emergency_issues) AS emergency_issues",
        "FROM {fqn}.parts_transactions_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How many distinct transactions appeared each month?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', txn_date) AS month, COUNT(DISTINCT transaction) AS distinct_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.parts_transactions",
        "GROUP BY 1",
        "ORDER BY 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total carrying cost trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, MEASURE(total_carrying_cost) AS total_carrying_cost",
        "FROM {fqn}.inventory_kpi_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has average average supplier lead time in days trended over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, AVG(avg_lead_time_days) AS avg_avg_lead_time_days",
        "FROM {fqn}.inventory_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY kpi_month",
        "ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total transaction quantity over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT txn_date, SUM(quantity) AS total_quantity",
        "FROM {fqn}.parts_transactions",
        "GROUP BY txn_date ORDER BY txn_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total quantity on hand over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(on_hand_qty) AS total_on_hand_qty",
        "FROM {fqn}.inventory_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average inventory turnover ratio changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, AVG(turnover_ratio) AS avg_turnover_ratio",
        "FROM {fqn}.inventory_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY kpi_month ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    }
  ],
